<p>Seeking Greenlights: yes.</p>
<p>Page Type: SCP Article</p>
<p>Elevator Pitch: there are two twins. one can create matter and the other can destroy it. because of this the foundation is practically at their feet trying to keep them to stay</p>
<p>Central Narrative: this SCP is a pair of two twins. the first twin can create matter. he can manifest objects, repair damaged cells, and create entirely new beings.</p>
<p>the second destroys matter. whatever he chooses can just be obliterated. he destroys matter on a cellular level</p>
<p>when discovered by the foundation, the mobile task force designated to locate them were massacred. so they had to coax them to enter the foundation willingly, which they do.</p>
<p>the foundation has no way to keep them contained so they have to pretty much treat them like royalty.</p>
<p>Hook/Attention-Grabber: I'm trying to switch the roles around. usually, the SCP foundation would be cruel in their containment, with this they are forced to treat the twins otherwise.</p>
<p>Additional Notes: i am not good at wording, so i may need some help in thoes areas</p>

