			<div class="content" id="post-content-4826974">
									

<p>There are a lot of spelling and grammar errors here, making it very difficult to read. Moreover, there's no narrative; it's just &quot;a thing that does a thing.&quot; Standards have risen since Series I, meaning you should really be telling some kind of story if you want your SCP to be successful.</p>
<p>I recommend pitching your idea to the critters in the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/c-89000/help:ideas-critique">Idea Critique Forum</a>. Furthermore, you should probably think about reading over <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/mackenzie-pitfalls">Dr. Mackenzie's Common SCP Pitfalls</a>.</p>

