<p>Seeking Greenlights: Yes</p>
<p>Page Type: SCP Article</p>
<p>Genre (Optional): Science Fiction</p>
<p>Page Layout (Optional):</p>
<p>Elevator Pitch:</p>
<ul>
<li>An crystal, that makes you have abilities similar to <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-076">SCP-076</a></li>
<li>It is a safe object, with Euclid containment procedures due to constant illegitimate use of the object</li>
</ul>
<p>Central Narrative: This SCP, is basically a crystal, that when someone approach it to the person's chest's, a gunge, start to take the user's body, later transforming it self into an outfit, and make's you have super human capabilities</p>
<p>The user of this SCP, may, keep weapons of his desire, in a &quot;layer&quot;, that the user may retrieve them at any time&#8230;</p>
<p>people who got to use the SCP, if they die they shall desintegrate them selfes, and in 3-7 days, they will get back, to a coffin, similar to SCP-076 but it highly depends on the user</p>
<p>the foundation formerly let the object either on a wood box, or in a cylindrical base, until there were people taking instances of this SCP<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-705525-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-705525-1')">1</a></sup>, making the foundation having to strict the containment procedures, but remaining, the object as a safe-class, since this isn't a containment problem but a non authorized usage problem&#8230;</p>
<p>Foundation Personal to use this SCP will need permission of the O5-2 to be given the key of this SCP, and use it for them selfes or for the Foundation purposes</p>
<p>there are 2 types of this instances, there are Purple crystals and red crystals, altough there is no difference between those two</p>
<p>The method of containment for this SCP is a metal restraint locked by key.</p>
<p>I seek feedback and criticism thanks&#8230;</p>
<p>sorry if I wrote bad english, it's not my native language</p>
