<p>Hey, I'm bubba808. I am a new user on the SCP wiki user that just got accepted today on 11/24/20. I recently got interested in the wiki again and finally pushed myself to apply and be able to interact with the community. It's possible I will change the name of my account in the future, but people can always refer to me as bubba or bubba808 and I will respond.</p>
<p>I am really looking forward to writing articles for this site because of the amazing ideas you can come up with. Whether its science fiction, horror, or a fairy tale there is something unique about writing on this website because it is collaborative and more open. Most of the writings here were just developed out of people's imaginations. Recently, I've been brainstorming up some SCPs and I have a few ideas. Although they are probably not that unique. I'm definitely not the best writer though so I hope to improve my writing during the course of my time here.</p>
<p>So this month's introduction question is what element best represents you. For me it would probably be earth or rock or whatever you want to call it because it is the most consistent and most sturdy element. I like to think I am reliable but that's debatable to say the least.</p>

