<p>Beyond this, I don't really have a feel for what the article is gonna be like: the implication here is that stylistically it'll be like <a href="/scp-1797-j">SCP-1797-J</a> in structure but it feels to me that you'd need to do something more than just, have nods to various popular musical songs with a SCP twist to them for it to work to me? Like, you ask if you'd need to include lyrics and it feels to me that really this wants just, a short list of sample songs followed by maybe some kinda experiment log where a d-class uses it and starts singing and someone reacts say or something like that.</p>

